'''Squirt Bottle''' (Japanese: '''ゼニガメじょうろ''' ''Zenigame Watering Can'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Discard a {{e|Fire}} Energy from your opponent's Active Pokémon.
}}

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*The [[Squirt Bottle]] is a [[Key Item]] in the [[Pokémon games]]. It is a [[watering can]] shaped like a {{p|Squirtle}}.

